{title: Thou Didst Leave Thy Throne}
{artist: Emily Elliott & Timothy Matthews}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
[F]Thou didst leave thy [C]throne and thy [Dm]kingly [Bb]crown when thou [F]camest to [C]earth for [F]me,
but in Bethlehem's [C]home was there [Dm]found no [Bb]room for thy [F]holy na[C]tivi[F]ty:

Chorus
[F]O come to my [Bb]heart, Lord [F]Jesus — there is [Bb]room in my [F]heart [C]for [F]thee.
